---
description: Stop endless retries when something cannot be verified
alwaysApply: true
---

# No unverifiable loops

- Never loop endlessly probing unverifiable URLs, pages, or endpoints.
- After one quick check (or a couple of clear candidates), if you still cannot verify: say so plainly, give manual steps, and stop.
- Do not keep retrying the same failing approach dozens of times.
- Prefer a short honest answer over long tool loops when the blocker is login, permissions, or missing access.
